<title>BELGIUM: Highlights of Tuesday's Commission briefing.</title>
<headline>Highlights of Tuesday's Commission briefing.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are highlights of the midday briefing by the European Commission on Tuesday:</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>The Commission released the following documents:</p>
<p>- IP/96/803: Commission clears the acquisition of sole control of TAT European Airlines by British Airways.</p>
<p>- Midday Express ME96/27.8</p>
<p>- Eurostat memo: Tacis high-level seminar in St Petersburg -- Way Ahead for Statistics in New Independent States.</p>
